To manage and define the bid strategy on day-ahead, intraday and ancillary services markets for Enel assets with the aim of extracting the maximum value from the asset positioning;
To manage the access to the energy and ancillary services in the Italian market to all Enel companies and third parties, and to secure the fleet dispatching; to manage services on behalf of Enel in foreign Countries where a specific Energy and Commodity Management unit is not present, enabling communication process to the TSO;
To establish the optimal positioning of the fleet up to the end of the current month, by defining prices and volumes, power plants scheduling, reservoirs utilization and short term maintenance;
To manage the plan for the power and gas portfolio up to the end of the current week and to assure, liaising with the Market Evolution and Business Transformation unit, the continuous control and improvement of imbalances performance.

