Cyber - Readiness Information Sharing Emergency (C-RISE) is the web portal of CERT Cyber Security used for:
-	enhancing and making more structured the Information sharing process;
-	supporting the Cyber Incident Response process

"The Comply system performs tax and accounting control in an integrated way using the data in the Corporate Base (Comply Database), the scope of operation meets not only the generation of tax obligations at the federal, state and Brazilians Municipal levels, but also enables companies to obtain a complete management of all the steps and activities necessary for this process to be completed successfully. Key Features. Region Brazil:
•    Calculation of withholding taxes: ISS;
•    Calculation of indirect taxes: ICMS, ICMS-ST, IPI, ISS, CIAP, Fund to Combat Poverty, Differential Rate and Calculation of manaus Free Zone;Control of opening and closing of period: with generation of the collection guides;
•    Generation of state obligations of all Brazilian States: GIA, GIA ST and SPED Fiscal;
•    Generation of municipal obligations: from the main Brazilian cities;"

