Design System - Mobile - Repository of Design Components to be applied to mobile applications.
The Design System will be exposed in internet and will be usable by all Frontent teams to visualize and export design atoms to be used during developments of Enel X Way app mobiles.
When accessing the Design System - Mobile website it will be possible:
 - consult Design atoms catalogue;
 - apply and preview changes on Design atoms;
 - export Design atoms and include them in the target mobile applications under developments;

Development Portal for the Grisdpertise co-innovation program with the below capabilities:
•	Habitability by the identification of reliable composable platform ecosystem; 
•	Quality Assurance to guarantee the right assets and template for client/partners;
•	Fast delivery using templates for application components;
•	Role management to diversify users access in base of capabilities, type of work and goals;  
•	Authentication and Authorization will be managed with different channels based on internal or external users;
•	Native cloud based on highly scalable microservices architecture based on CNCF standards;
•	Distinct elements built for standardize QEd ecosystems;
•	Modular in order to guarantee a high degree of flexibility and ease of evolution;
•	Maintainable thanks to the use of programming standards and development frameworks

THE DFU2RE PLATFORM integrates video monitoring and image collection processes autonomously with the WEB visualization platform.
- Digitization of Video Monitoring;
- Video analysis by computer vision (AI);
- Automation of video downloads between vehicles and the cloud.

Application of the SaaS LegalBus InfoCert electronic seal with the aim of being able to be invoked of Enel solutions by leveraging the Platform's "by design" security, tracking and scalability potential.
The following functionalities are provided:
- Enabling the Solution to use the electronic seal in Platform;
- Exposure of the API for affixing the seal in Platform;
- Solution configuration;
- Tracking of API usage;
- Monitoring and reporting of activities.

